SnekPad is licensed in two parts. Each folder has its own LICENSE file:

  Programs/   The pad firmware (code.py, boot.py, the modules it loads, and the
              build and flash tools)
              GNU General Public License v3.0 - see Programs/LICENSE
              The firmware is built on KMK (https://github.com/KMKfw/kmk_firmware),
              which is GPL-3.0, so the firmware has to be GPL-3.0 as well.

  app/        SnekPad Studio, the desktop app
              MIT License - see app/LICENSE
              The app is a separate program that talks to the pad over a serial
              port. It does not contain KMK.

Third-party components and their licenses are listed in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md.
The SnekPad name and logo are not covered by either license.
